<title>NETHERLANDS: ERIKS 1996 NET IN LINE WITH FORECAST.</title>
<headline>ERIKS 1996 NET IN LINE WITH FORECAST.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	    12.52 vs  13.05</p>
<p>    Net profit			    22.3  vs  23.2</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  6.25 vs   6.50</p>
<p>    Turnover			     453.3  vs 427.8</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    33.6  vs  35.8</p>
<p>    Interest income			0.8  vs   1.9</p>
<p>    Tax				     11.8  vs  14.0</p>
<p>NOTE - Technical wholesaler Eriks Holding NV said in</p>
<p>February it expected a 1996 net profit of 22.3 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
